OL,5,G0600 Gwen John: A Portrait of
OL,6,G     Independence
OL,7,     FJourney through the trailblazing
OL,8,     Flife and art of Gwen John, from
OL,9,     Fher beginnings in Tenby to the
OL,10,     Fartistic hubs of London and Paris.
OL,11,G0630 Body Donation - Mum's Final Gift
OL,12,     FAfter her mum told her that she
OL,13,     Fhas decided to donate her body for
OL,14,     Feducation and training when she
OL,15,     Fdies, Lucy Owen heads to Cardiff
OL,16,     FUniversity to find out what that
OL,17,     Factually means.
OL,18,G0700 Country Focus
OL,19,     FWe visit the Royal Welsh Grassland
OL,20,     FEvent, hear about the Curlews in
OL,21,     FNorth Wales, and visit a busy farm
OL,22,     Fnear Pontypool.
